# 14. Firmware/model/config parity

When comparing APs, automatically check where MCP exposes the information:

* model
* firmware
* hardware revision
* WLAN configuration
* security
* RADIUS configuration
* switch
* port
* channel
* band
* uptime
* reboot history

In our environment:

```text
AP03 = AP45
AP04 = AP45
AP07 = AP45

Firmware:
0.14.29967
```

So firmware/model/hardware revision were not differentiators.

Do not repeatedly use already-ruled-out differences as RCA candidates.

