# 18. PCAP must CORRELATE with MCP

PCAP analysis is not a standalone report.

The engine must correlate:

```text
MCP timestamp
+
PCAP timestamp
+
client MAC
+
AP/BSSID
+
event
```

Example:

```text
MCP:
AP03 authentication failure
15:54:23

PCAP:
EAPOL Start
15:54:22.812

EAP exchange
15:54:23.xxx

No response / timeout
15:54:xx

↓
```

This can materially increase confidence.

But only if the packet evidence actually supports the interpretation.

